mation}\n% REQUIRED: Replace this scaffold with substantive grounded content.\n\\subsection{Reproducibility Details}\nReplace with grounded extended methods, reproducibility details, additional analyses, or supporting tables and figures.\n\n\\end{document}\n/usr/bin/pdflatex\nnode-compile-cache\nopencode\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
